# Keys here are relative to Mods.Levy.Progression (progression assistance strings).
PlanteraRepeat: Plantera already defeated
JungleChlorophyte: Killed in the Jungle after Plantera
EventChlorophyte: Killed during the Pumpkin Moon, Frost Moon or Lunar Event
JungleUelibloom: Killed in the Jungle after Providence
MagnetReformed: The Exodium planetoids form again high above the world.
MagnetCooling: The magnet is still humming. Ready in {0} minutes.
AuricRegen: Auric Ore stirs deep in the world.
